{"id": "EUVD-2026-102263", "enisaUuid": "29b00b34-08e3-39fc-8242-90f3e3d1fbec", "description": "libInstPatch through 1.1.7 contains a heap out-of-bounds write vulnerability in the SoundFont 2 loader because ipatch_sf2_gen_is_valid() does not range-check generator IDs before the validity mask test. Attackers can supply crafted SF2 files with out-of-range pgen or igen generator IDs to write attacker-chosen values past the zone genarray, corrupting heap memory and crashing Swami or other consumers.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T19:48:10", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/libinstpatch-sf2-generator-id-oob-write", "https://github.com/swami/libinstpatch/blob/4ff1939ccc24de204d41b3ab734fc1aece919184/libinstpatch/IpatchSF2Gen.c#L189-L205", "https://github.com/swami/libinstpatch/blob/4ff1939ccc24de204d41b3ab734fc1aece919184/libinstpatch/IpatchSF2Reader.c#L1355-L1370", "https://github.com/swami/libinstpatch/blob/4ff1939ccc24de204d41b3ab734fc1aece919184/libinstpatch/IpatchSF2Reader.c#L954-L969", "https://github.com/swami/libinstpatch", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libinstpatch-through-1.1.7-heap-out-of-bounds-write-via-ipatch-sf2-gen-is-valid"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6p4q-22pq-927g", "CVE-2026-111136"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4a6755fa-a676-3ea5-ae78-b5267e96368c", "product": {"name": "libinstpatch", "vendor": {"name": "swami"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.1.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ec13304e-a2e4-3bff-b0f9-f13321ed0cb7", "vendor": {"name": "swami"}}], "isExploited": false}